ParCool! 1.12.2 — unofficial backport
=====================================

This repository contains an UNOFFICIAL backport of ParCool! to Minecraft 1.12.2.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the original author.
Please do not report problems with this backport to the original author.


