Scope of modifications (LGPL-3.0 section 5(a) notice)
-----------------------------------------------------
This is a modified version of the original work. Date of modification: 2026.

Principal modifications:
  * Ported from Minecraft 1.16.5 / Forge 36.x to Minecraft 1.12.2 /
    Forge 14.23.5.2864 (MCP stable_39 mappings).
  * Rewritten client rendering layer (player model transform, rope rendering,
    stamina HUD) for the 1.12.2 model/render pipeline.
  * Added the server-side "limitation" subsystem and the /parcool command tree
    using the 1.12.2 ICommand API (1.16.5 used Brigadier).
  * Integrated configuration through Forge's native 1.12.2 config GUI, with
    hot-sync of client settings and explicit persistence of changes.
  * Added English/Chinese localisation for the configuration interface.
  * Aqua Acrobatics is used as a required API dependency instead of being
    bundled or reimplemented.

See docs/ and the git history for a detailed record of the changes.


